  "prefLabel": "Home 105.03 Board Meeting Procedures",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Home 105.03 Board Meeting Procedures. The board shall conduct its meetings in the following order:\n\n(a) Reading of the minutes;\n\n(b) Interviews/meetings;\n\n(c) Reading of communications;\n\n(d) Reading and consideration of applications;\n\n(e) Unfinished business;\n\n(f) New business; and\n\n(g) Adjournment.\n\nSource. #9503, eff 7-8-09",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/home100-600.html"
